{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hong Kong, 1956.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127790/extras/573be4590701d983265f6e469867f34f.avif?t=1761912341\" width=1377 height=560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You came here bright and joyful, following your husband from Scotland to his post on Hong Kong island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Months later, you are bloodied, cold, starving, lost in Kowloon. Missing posters bearing your face fray at the edges\u00a0and you don\u2019t recognise yourself anymore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you smell blood - a potential meal - you find a local on the verge of death. After feeding on his attackers, you\u2019re offered a job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive as a young, lost vampire in Kowloon and navigate its dark depths, but beware; you're not the only thing that lurks within them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNDYING: Kowloon in Red</strong> is a visual novel/RPG hybrid where you grow as a vampire, using skills and vampiric abilities to overcome challenges and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127790/extras/f11cfc8a9b3db0a8e2ec031758edfbf0.avif?t=1761912341\" width=1560 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127790/extras/9a406a6e5ffdd0181a5b1723bee69d9a.avif?t=1761912341\" width=1377 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must feed on blood to survive, and your growing\u00a0hunger affects your skills and unlocks\u00a0abilities. Plan your feedings wisely; even well-timed starvation has its uses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127790/extras/7fe9308cbacead81d9e69d2f713d7ec8.avif?t=1761912341\" width=1377 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night brings new quests, opportunities and unfolding stories. Meet its challenges and grow in strength; or fail, explore alternate solutions, and try anew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127790/extras/5b6990b5645b565e3ad7deea5bdd436f.avif?t=1761912341\" width=1377 height=301 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The people of Hong Kong are not unaware; take care to balance their growing suspicion and your overwhelming thirst.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127790/extras/60a1e29b285dbeb53a6a85565d5c2fe9.avif?t=1761912341\" width=1377 height=468 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many hands reach for Hong Kong; triads, the colonial government, the exiled Nationalists, local Communists, suspicious American operatives, and those that remain in the shadows... Ally yourself with whoever you wish, and even pursue romance;\u00a0but know this will have consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127790/extras/b44b0b0d8e184abc61abdc6b90298cd9.avif?t=1761912341\" width=1560 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127790/extras/b3c7876a13a89aa018164937cd2ad925.avif?t=1761912341\" width=1377 height=468 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The man you saved; the man who saved you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Officially an innocent <i>cha chaan teng</i> owner; in reality, the manager of a gambling house and a loanshark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127790/extras/f1b5c2f1abc3e16f1d47c96d2b5d3460.avif?t=1761912341\" width=1377 height=468 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jin-kwan\u2019s right-hand woman, in charge of the workers of the gambling den.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You scare her in more ways than one; she always feared the <i>gweilo</i>, but you are the first real demon she\u2019s met.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4127790?t=1761912341","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4127790?t=1761912341","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127790/af99e8617a7c7aa117fe20485fcbf6152b8203b0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761912341","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127790/af99e8617a7c7aa117fe20485fcbf6152b8203b0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761912341","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game has a focus on feeding on blood, and gore is depicted visually in some instances. There's also mentions of drug use (opium) and gambling."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hong Kong, 1956.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127790/extras/573be4590701d983265f6e469867f34f.avif?t=1761912341\" width=1377 height=560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You came here bright and joyful, following your husband from Scotland to his post on Hong Kong island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Months later, you are bloodied, cold, starving, lost in Kowloon. Missing posters bearing your face fray at the edges\u00a0and you don\u2019t recognise yourself anymore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you smell blood - a potential meal - you find a local on the verge of death. After feeding on his attackers, you\u2019re offered a job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive as a young, lost vampire in Kowloon and navigate its dark depths, but beware; you're not the only thing that lurks within them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNDYING: Kowloon in Red</strong> is a visual novel/RPG hybrid where you grow as a vampire, using skills and vampiric abilities to overcome challenges and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127790/extras/f11cfc8a9b3db0a8e2ec031758edfbf0.avif?t=1761912341\" width=1560 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127790/extras/9a406a6e5ffdd0181a5b1723bee69d9a.avif?t=1761912341\" width=1377 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must feed on blood to survive, and your growing\u00a0hunger affects your skills and unlocks\u00a0abilities. Plan your feedings wisely; even well-timed starvation has its uses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127790/extras/7fe9308cbacead81d9e69d2f713d7ec8.avif?t=1761912341\" width=1377 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night brings new quests, opportunities and unfolding stories. Meet its challenges and grow in strength; or fail, explore alternate solutions, and try anew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127790/extras/5b6990b5645b565e3ad7deea5bdd436f.avif?t=1761912341\" width=1377 height=301 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The people of Hong Kong are not unaware; take care to balance their growing suspicion and your overwhelming thirst.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127790/extras/60a1e29b285dbeb53a6a85565d5c2fe9.avif?t=1761912341\" width=1377 height=468 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many hands reach for Hong Kong; triads, the colonial government, the exiled Nationalists, local Communists, suspicious American operatives, and those that remain in the shadows... Ally yourself with whoever you wish, and even pursue romance;\u00a0but know this will have consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127790/extras/b44b0b0d8e184abc61abdc6b90298cd9.avif?t=1761912341\" width=1560 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127790/extras/b3c7876a13a89aa018164937cd2ad925.avif?t=1761912341\" width=1377 height=468 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The man you saved; the man who saved you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Officially an innocent <i>cha chaan teng</i> owner; in reality, the manager of a gambling house and a loanshark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127790/extras/f1b5c2f1abc3e16f1d47c96d2b5d3460.avif?t=1761912341\" width=1377 height=468 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jin-kwan\u2019s right-hand woman, in charge of the workers of the gambling den.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You scare her in more ways than one; she always feared the <i>gweilo</i>, but you are the first real demon she\u2019s met.</p>","developers":["maneki-mushi"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127790/ba57d14d016ed5a6f637f58aa7c84c9d68de4241/header.jpg?t=1761912341","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS 10.9 (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"name":"UNDYING: Kowloon in Red","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platform